  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Policy Advocacy for Standardized Prosecutorial Response to Gender-Based and Domestic Violence including the Digital Dimension in BiH</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to transform how Bosnia and Herzegovina&#x2019;s justice system prosecutes gender-based and domestic violence. Despite strong laws, prosecutorial practice remains inconsistent and fragmented, leaving victims vulnerable. The Foundation of Local Democracy will lead a one-year national effort to close this gap by developing mandatory prosecutorial instructions, improving data use through the Case Management System (CMS), and building stronger cooperation with NGOs and law enforcement.</narrative>
  </description>
